title: "Beta Version released: 2.4beta3"
date: 2008-12-08T16:03:00+00:00
author: dualon
Tags:
- RT 2.4
---


<div id="article_show_text"><p>Thanks to the detailed bug reports several bugs have been fixed.</p>
<p>Bug fixes compared to beta2 are:</p>
<ul><li>dcraw updated to version 8.89 </li>
<li>improvements in internalization </li>
<li>an exif saving problem in jpeg output </li>
<li>corrupted saving of large tiff files </li>
<li>problems with preview zoom when images of the same size are opened </li>
<li>corrupt output color profile in the saved images</li>
<li>incorrect permissions for the "converted" directory under linux</li>
<li>auto and spot wb for sRaw and linear dng fixed </li>
</ul><p>Known issues:</p>
<ul><li>still no solution on the library dependency problems under older linux distributions</li>
</ul></div>

